<!-- 设计稿「补录记录」：手工新增一条设备漏报的出入库记录（yeweiyi-cloud#69），和"修正已有记录"是两件事。
     管理员可提交；员工只能预览（见 backfill.ts）。 -->
<view wx:if="{{state !== 'ok' && state !== 'loading'}}" class="card banner-warning" style="margin:16rpx 24rpx 0;">
  <text class="text-warning">{{notice}}</text>
  <button wx:if="{{state === 'no-station'}}" class="btn-primary" size="mini" bindtap="onGoHome" style="margin-top:16rpx;">{{text.goHome}}</button>
  <button wx:if="{{state === 'error'}}" class="btn-primary" size="mini" bindtap="onRetry" style="margin-top:16rpx;">{{text.retry}}</button>
</view>
<view wx:if="{{state === 'ok'}}" style="padding-top:45rpx;">
  <view class="muted" style="padding:0 53rpx 24rpx;">{{text.target}}{{stationName}} · {{device}}</view>
  <view wx:if="{{!canSubmit}}" class="muted" style="padding:0 53rpx 24rpx;">{{text.readOnly}}</view>
  <view class="bf-title">{{text.inTitle}}</view>
  <view class="fc" style="margin-top:0;padding:19rpx 0 18rpx;">
    <view class="fr" id="row-inbound-tank" data-kind="inbound" bindtap="onOpenTank">
      <text class="fl">{{form.tankNo}}</text>
      <text class="fv {{inbound.tankIndex < 0 ? 'fv-ph' : ''}}">{{inbound.tankIndex < 0 ? form.select : tankOptions[inbound.tankIndex]}}</text>
      <image class="fc-chevron" src="/assets/icons/chevron-right.png" mode="aspectFit" />
    </view>
    <picker mode="date" end="{{maxDate}}" value="{{inbound.date}}" data-kind="inbound" data-field="date" bindchange="onField">
      <view class="fr">
        <text class="fl">{{text.inTime}}</text>
        <text class="fv {{inbound.date ? '' : 'fv-ph'}}">{{inbound.date || form.select}}</text>
        <image class="fc-chevron" src="/assets/icons/chevron-right.png" mode="aspectFit" />
      </view>
    </picker>
    <picker mode="time" value="{{inbound.time}}" data-kind="inbound" data-field="time" bindchange="onField">
      <view class="fr">
        <text class="fl">{{text.clock}}</text>
        <text class="fv {{inbound.time ? '' : 'fv-ph'}}">{{inbound.time || form.select}}</text>
        <image class="fc-chevron" src="/assets/icons/chevron-right.png" mode="aspectFit" />
      </view>
    </picker>
    <view class="fr">
      <text class="fl">{{text.inBefore}}</text>
      <input class="fi" type="digit" placeholder="0" placeholder-class="fv-ph" value="{{inbound.beforeLevel}}" data-kind="inbound" data-field="beforeLevel" bindinput="onField" />
      <text class="fu">{{form.mm}}</text>
    </view>
    <view class="fr">
      <text class="fl">{{text.inVolume}}</text>
      <input class="fi" type="digit" placeholder="0" placeholder-class="fv-ph" value="{{inbound.volume}}" data-kind="inbound" data-field="volume" bindinput="onField" />
      <text class="fu">{{form.liter}}</text>
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{canSubmit}}" class="fr">
      <text class="fl">{{text.reason}}</text>
      <input class="fi" style="width:auto;flex:1;" type="text" maxlength="200" placeholder="{{text.reasonPlaceholder}}" placeholder-class="fv-ph" value="{{inbound.reason}}" data-kind="inbound" data-field="reason" bindinput="onField" />
    </view>
  </view>
  <view class="pill-row" style="margin-top:55rpx;">
    <button wx:if="{{canSubmit}}" class="pill pill-green" data-kind="inbound" loading="{{submitting === 'inbound'}}" disabled="{{!!submitting}}" bindtap="onSave">{{text.submit}}</button>
    <button class="pill pill-indigo" data-kind="inbound" bindtap="onPreview">{{text.preview}}</button>
  </view>
  <view style="height:102rpx;"></view>
  <view class="bf-title">{{text.outTitle}}</view>
  <view class="fc" style="margin-top:0;padding:19rpx 0 18rpx;">
    <view class="fr" id="row-outbound-tank" data-kind="outbound" bindtap="onOpenTank">
      <text class="fl">{{form.tankNo}}</text>
      <text class="fv {{outbound.tankIndex < 0 ? 'fv-ph' : ''}}">{{outbound.tankIndex < 0 ? form.select : tankOptions[outbound.tankIndex]}}</text>
      <image class="fc-chevron" src="/assets/icons/chevron-right.png" mode="aspectFit" />
    </view>
    <picker mode="date" end="{{maxDate}}" value="{{outbound.date}}" data-kind="outbound" data-field="date" bindchange="onField">
      <view class="fr">
        <text class="fl">{{text.outTime}}</text>
        <text class="fv {{outbound.date ? '' : 'fv-ph'}}">{{outbound.date || form.select}}</text>
        <image class="fc-chevron" src="/assets/icons/chevron-right.png" mode="aspectFit" />
      </view>
    </picker>
    <picker mode="time" value="{{outbound.time}}" data-kind="outbound" data-field="time" bindchange="onField">
      <view class="fr">
        <text class="fl">{{text.clock}}</text>
        <text class="fv {{outbound.time ? '' : 'fv-ph'}}">{{outbound.time || form.select}}</text>
        <image class="fc-chevron" src="/assets/icons/chevron-right.png" mode="aspectFit" />
      </view>
    </picker>
    <view class="fr">
      <text class="fl">{{text.outBefore}}</text>
      <input class="fi" type="digit" placeholder="0" placeholder-class="fv-ph" value="{{outbound.beforeLevel}}" data-kind="outbound" data-field="beforeLevel" bindinput="onField" />
      <text class="fu">{{form.mm}}</text>
    </view>
    <view class="fr">
      <text class="fl">{{text.outVolume}}</text>
      <input class="fi" type="digit" placeholder="0" placeholder-class="fv-ph" value="{{outbound.volume}}" data-kind="outbound" data-field="volume" bindinput="onField" />
      <text class="fu">{{form.liter}}</text>
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{canSubmit}}" class="fr">
      <text class="fl">{{text.reason}}</text>
      <input class="fi" style="width:auto;flex:1;" type="text" maxlength="200" placeholder="{{text.reasonPlaceholder}}" placeholder-class="fv-ph" value="{{outbound.reason}}" data-kind="outbound" data-field="reason" bindinput="onField" />
    </view>
  </view>
  <view class="pill-row" style="margin-top:55rpx;">
    <button wx:if="{{canSubmit}}" class="pill pill-green" data-kind="outbound" loading="{{submitting === 'outbound'}}" disabled="{{!!submitting}}" bindtap="onSave">{{text.submit}}</button>
    <button class="pill pill-indigo" data-kind="outbound" bindtap="onPreview">{{text.preview}}</button>
  </view>
</view>

<grid-picker show="{{pickerShow}}" top="{{pickerTop}}" options="{{tankOptions}}" value="{{pickerValue}}" bind:pick="onPickTank" bind:close="onClosePicker" />
